Precision qanday hisoblanadi?
A) TP / (TP + FP)
B) TP / (TP + FN)
C) (TP + TN) / hammasi
ANSWER: A

Sinflar juda nomutanosib bo'lsa, accuracy nega aldaydi?
A) Ko'pchilik sinfni aytgan model ham yuqori aniqlik oladi
B) Accuracy faqat regressiyada ishlaydi
C) Accuracy manfiy bo'lishi mumkin
ANSWER: A

AUC = 0.5 nimani bildiradi?
A) Mukammal model
B) Tasodifiy taxmin darajasi
C) Har doim noto'g'ri model
ANSWER: B
